GETTING STARTED

Welcome to ICARUS - the paragliding simulator game.

When you start the game, it will be paused.  Press P to unpause and start paragliding!

The physics settings at the lower left of the screen can be changed / saved / loaded from inside the game.

Have fun!

Please feel free to send feedback to the email shown at http://icarus.fan

*

HOW TO SHARE PHYSICS SETTINGS

When the game settings get saved, it creates two INI (text) files next to the paragliding executable (exe) file.

To share these with someone, save in-game with the N key, then you can send the INI (text) files to them.

To load settings sent to you, copy/paste them next to the paragliding exe file.  Then load in-game with the M key.

